cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Molecule Design Assistant (chemtool)"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic chemistry workbench that simulates and balances chemical
  reactions with analysis reports, designs candidate analogs and scores
  molecular properties, and searches compounds live on PubChem. All
  calculations run on device with no AI API key required.
authors:
